<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Intellect half year loss narrows.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Intellect half year loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating		     loss 1.81 vs loss 3.10</p>
<p>    Net			     loss 0.96 vs loss 1.94</p>
<p>    Sales				 22.53 vs 14.63</p>
<p>    Other income			 0.09 vs 0.69</p>
<p>    Tax			   credit 0.85 vs credit 1.17</p>
<p>    Interest			     0.30 vs 0.20</p>
<p>    Depreciation			 0.56 vs 0.56</p>
<p>NOTE: Intellect Holdings Ltd is a developer of transactions technology. The company said it expects a positive result for the full year to June 1997.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
